%description:
Tests a locked receive buffer that is smaller than one MSS after the truesize
charge. The server application sets SO_RCVBUF to 1000 bytes before the open
(socketReceiveBufferSize), and the client sends 3000 bytes with an MSS of 1000.
The first offer is the buffer (1000). A segment of 1000 bytes costs a truesize
of 2280 bytes, so the empty buffer offers only 437 bytes (1000 at the ratio
112/256). That offer is less than one MSS, but it is the whole buffer, so the
receiver SWS rule does not hold it back, and the window stays open at 437.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 10s
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 3000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.*_tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = false
*.srv_app.socketReceiveBufferSize = 1000

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 1000   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.003 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 437 
[2.005 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1001:1438(437) ack 501 win 16384 
[2.007 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1438 win 437 
[3.009 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1438:1875(437) ack 501 win 16384 
[3.011 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1875 win 437 
[4.013 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1875:2312(437) ack 501 win 16384 
[4.015 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2312 win 437 
[5.017 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2312:2749(437) ack 501 win 16384 
[5.019 B006] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2749 win 437 
[5.021 A008] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2749:3001(252) ack 501 win 16384 
[5.023 B007] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 3001 win 437 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
